From c582d97cbd0395474ebede8049bd7a63bd99a1f8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: eelgaev <3100771+eelgaev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 22:09:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] mm: provide compatible lifetime exports for POWER9
 NVLink2

The IBM ATS VA-space/mm association in NVIDIA 550.54.15 introduces mmput()
and __mmdrop() imports. UVM inherits proprietary taint from NVIDIA's core
module and cannot resolve GPL-only exports of these functions.

Older kernels also exported these functions GPL-only, but allowed UVM's
Dual MIT/GPL module to use them before proprietary-taint inheritance was
enforced. Provide non-GPL exports when CONFIG_PPC_POWERNV_NVLINK2 is
enabled, preserving the current MM implementations and GPL-only exports
for other configurations. NVIDIA conftest still checks the production
NPU API and MM export availability before enabling ATS.

Signed-off-by: eelgaev <3100771+eelgaev@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 kernel/fork.c | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/kernel/fork.c b/kernel/fork.c
index c0ecb097a..4b5fc831f 100644
--- a/kernel/fork.c
+++ b/kernel/fork.c
@@ -946,7 +946,12 @@ void __mmdrop(struct mm_struct *mm)
 
 	free_mm(mm);
 }
+#if IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_PPC_POWERNV_NVLINK2)
+/* Legacy IBM ATS UVM uses this MM lifetime API. */
+EXPORT_SYMBOL(__mmdrop);
+#else
 EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(__mmdrop);
+#endif
 
 static void mmdrop_async_fn(struct work_struct *work)
 {
@@ -1389,7 +1394,12 @@ void mmput(struct mm_struct *mm)
 	if (atomic_dec_and_test(&mm->mm_users))
 		__mmput(mm);
 }
+#if IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_PPC_POWERNV_NVLINK2)
+/* Legacy IBM ATS UVM uses this MM lifetime API. */
+EXPORT_SYMBOL(mmput);
+#else
 EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(mmput);
+#endif
 
 #ifdef CONFIG_MMU
 static void mmput_async_fn(struct work_struct *work)
